# Authoritative line-ending rules for the whole repository.
#
# Without this, committing from Windows warns on every file and a clone on
# another platform sees the whole tree as modified. app/.gitattributes and
# research/.gitattributes still exist and are redundant with this file; they are
# kept for now so either folder stays self-contained if extracted on its own.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Marked explicitly rather than left to content detection, since a file wrongly
# treated as text would be corrupted by normalisation. research/results holds 46
# plot PNGs that neither subdirectory file covers: app/.gitattributes marks PNGs
# but only reaches app/, and research/.gitattributes marks nothing as binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.joblib binary
*.pkl binary
*.npy binary
